will follow you in a long queue. The more kids you have, and the higher you climb, the more points you will score.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/906110/extras/5dc9eb88121a61a7ff36fcb4db9098a2.avif?t=1742484205\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>Eat grass and find objects to give birth.</i></h2><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/906110/extras/12b9910b720f389be4e94dafe0063643.avif?t=1742484205\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>If you are careful you may be able to bop musk oxen for more points.</i></h2><br><br>Climb up through a variety of themed zones. Discover powerups that can augment your powers for a while as you climb. Can you make it to the top? What happens if you do?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/906110/extras/01c50ac1ac4461a678d308e172a53400.avif?t=1742484205\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>Discover new zones as you climb.</i></h2><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/906110/extras/606a17ec83473b4253f5e468a95113b1.avif?t=1742484205\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>Perhaps you will see some denizens you recognize.</i></h2><br><br>If you have VR, put on your headset and get closer to your growing family!",
